### Esempi di richieste per l'estensione "REST Client" di VS Code.
### Dopo il login il cookie di sessione viene salvato e inviato in automatico alle richieste successive.
@base = http://localhost:3000/api

### Registrazione
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"prova@example.test","username":"ProvaHunter","password":"Password123"}

### Login (imposta il cookie di sessione httpOnly)
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"AlexHunter","password":"HunterGym123!"}

### Profilo dell'utente collegato
GET {{base}}/auth/me

### Logout (elimina la sessione)
POST {{base}}/auth/logout

### Senza cookie di sessione deve rispondere 401: esegui prima il logout
GET {{base}}/auth/me

### --- Quest ---
GET {{base}}/quests/today

###
GET {{base}}/quests/history

### Segna una quest completata scegliendo un amico verificatore
POST {{base}}/quests/1/complete
Content-Type: application/json

{"verifierId":2}

### Quest da approvare come amico
GET {{base}}/quests/verifications/incoming

###
GET {{base}}/quests/pending

### Approva (true) o rifiuta (false) una quest
POST {{base}}/quests/1/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{"approved":true}

### --- Amici ---
GET {{base}}/users/search?username=mi

###
POST {{base}}/friends/requests
Content-Type: application/json

{"userId":2}

###
GET {{base}}/friends/requests

###
POST {{base}}/friends/requests/1/accept

###
POST {{base}}/friends/requests/1/reject

###
GET {{base}}/friends

###
GET {{base}}/friends/leaderboard

###
DELETE {{base}}/friends/2

### --- Arena ---
POST {{base}}/battles
Content-Type: application/json

{"opponentId":2}

### Storico (riassunto) e dettaglio con registro dei turni
GET {{base}}/battles

###
GET {{base}}/battles/1

### --- Profilo ---
GET {{base}}/profile

###
PUT {{base}}/profile/item
Content-Type: application/json

{"itemId":1}

###
PUT {{base}}/profile/password
Content-Type: application/json

{"currentPassword":"password-attuale","newPassword":"password-nuova"}

### Scelta della classe dopo aver raggiunto 33000 XP
PUT {{base}}/profile/monarch-class
Content-Type: application/json

{"monarchClass":"Ombre"}

### --- Admin: solo con l'account admin ---
POST {{base}}/admin/self/rewards
Content-Type: application/json

{"xp":100000,"str":100000,"vit":100000,"agi":100000}
